dsh-ascii-sharks bundles a modified version of ascii-sharks.

  ascii-sharks — https://github.com/stackedlol/ascii-sharks
  Copyright (c) stackedlol
  No licence file was published with the original project; the source is
  redistributed here with attribution and modification notes in README.md.

Modifications for DeepSeek Harness:
  - the canvas is transparent instead of opaque black, so the host app's own
    background shows through;
  - colour, ink direction, grid strength and skin brightness are palette-driven
    instead of hard-coded, which adds a light theme;
  - the engine is wrapped in a wallpaper host that follows the conversation
    column, fades against the empty-state hero, and exposes a settings panel;
  - a settings model, a DSH client bundle and its build script were added.
